place_lore.nirncraft.eldergleam_sanctuar:
~Walk soft, walk slow, and leave your steel;
~The roots go deeper than your graves.
~What the Gleam gives, the Gleam may heal;
~What the Gleam keeps, the Gleam still saves.

place_lore.nirncraft.falinesti_winter_si:
~Bare bough, bare bough, hold the sky;
~old root, old root, do not die;
~walk, O city, when you will,
~and wait for us upon the hill.
